{"title": "Template:Infobox command", "pageid": 12055, "revid": 39048, "timestamp": "2019-04-16T08:41:45Z", "wikitext": "<includeonly><!--\n\n--><div class=\"fo-nttax-infobox-wrapper infobox-{{{game|dota2}}}\">\n<div class=\"fo-nttax-infobox wiki-bordercolor-light\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"infobox-header wiki-backgroundcolor-light\"><span class=\"infobox-buttons\"><nowiki>[</nowiki>[{{SERVER}}{{localurl:{{FULLPAGENAME}}|action=edit&section=0}} e]<nowiki>]</nowiki><nowiki>[</nowiki>[[Template:Infobox_map|h]]<nowiki>]</nowiki></span>{{{name|{{FULLPAGENAME}}}}}</div>\n</div><!--\n\nImage\n\n-->{{#if:{{{image|}}}|\n<div>\n<div class=\"infobox-image\">[[File:{{{image}}}|center|600px]]</div>\n</div>\n}}<!--\n\nCreator\n\n-->{{#if:{{{creator|}}}|\n<div>\n<div class=\"infobox-cell-2 infobox-description\">Creator:</div>\n<div class=\"infobox-cell-2\">{{{creator}}}</div>\n</div>\n}}<!--\n\nReleased year\n\n-->{{#if:{{{year|}}}|\n<div>\n<div class=\"infobox-cell-2 infobox-description\">Released:</div>\n<div class=\"infobox-cell-2\">{{{year}}}</div>\n</div>\n}}<!--\n\nType\n\n-->{{#if:{{{type|}}}|\n<div>\n<div class=\"infobox-cell-2 infobox-description\">Type:</div>\n<div class=\"infobox-cell-2\">{{{type}}}</div>\n</div>\n}}<!--\n\nSort\n\n-->{{#if:{{{sort|}}}|\n<div>\n<div class=\"infobox-cell-2 infobox-description\">Sort:</div>\n<div class=\"infobox-cell-2\">{{{sort}}}</div>\n</div>\n}}<!--\n\nAdbox\n\n--></div>\n\n</div><!--\n\nCategories\n\n-->[[Category:Commands]]\n<!--\n\n--></includeonly><noinclude>{{documentation}}[[Category:Infoboxes]][[Category:Commands]]</noinclude>", "categories": ["Category:Commands", "Category:Infoboxes"]}